<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:44:16 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>我的独立出版物 Brennan.day 新设计的品牌板，介绍了由我制作的新自定义调色板，以及 Bunny Fonts 提供的字体。</title><link>https://some.pics/6abc4d4d83229</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我的独立出版物 Brennan.day 新设计的品牌板，介绍了由我制作的新自定义调色板，以及 Bunny Fonts 提供的字体。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Brand board for brennan.day showing two colour palettes and three typefaces. The "Sunflower" light-mode palette lists neutrals White, Cultured Pearl, Gallery, Cod Gray, Tundora, and Alto, plus accents Cardinal (red), Rock Spray (orange), Chelsea Gem (olive/gold), Jewel (green), Metallic Seaweed (teal), New Car (blue), and Electric Violet (purple), each with hex codes. The "Moonflower" dark-mode palette lists neutrals Cod Gray, Eerie Black, Eerie Black+, Concrete, Nobel, and Tundora, plus accents Shimmering Blush (pink), Porsche (orange), Gold, Emerald (green), Cyan, Malibu (light blue), and Mauve (purple), each with hex codes. 

Below, three typefaces show sample uppercase, lowercase, and numeral glyphs: Young Serif for headings and titles, Newsreader (with italic) for body text, and Public Sans (with bold) for navigation, UI, and metadata. All served by Bunny Fonts.' height="1586" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/brennan/6abc4d4d83229.png" width="1238"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://brennan.some.pics"&gt;@brennan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:44:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>你们还记得可口可乐零度曾经用白色罐装的时候吗？</title><link>https://some.pics/6abc201f57e92</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你们还记得可口可乐零度曾经用白色罐装的时候吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Multiple Coca-Cola Zero Sugar cans stacked together, showing the product's red and white branding and &amp;quot;zero&amp;quot; text on silver packaging." height="1920" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6abc201f57e92.jpg" width="2560"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:31:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大峡谷的日落

